      "side": 1,
      "message": "why is this needed? If you have a ramdump, then you can look at devices_kset-\u003elist and see which dev is causing the hang-during-shutdown case you describe. This hook seems unnecessary.",
      "revId": "123ef0a2c5f4b62db9edec5b99d2203e2ea0644a",
